  "description": "Operating Area: Caribbean Virgin Islands (BVI)\n\nStep aboard Saint Sophie, where spacious living, privacy, and effortless island style come together to create a beautiful home on the water.\n\nDesigned for guests who want to truly settle into yacht life, Saint Sophie offers generous, thoughtfully appointed accommodations with the comfort and privacy to unwind after a full day exploring the Caribbean. Her inviting cabins provide peaceful personal retreats, complemented by private bathroom facilities and plenty of space to unpack, relax, and feel at home.\n\nWake each morning surrounded by turquoise water, enjoy a quiet moment before breakfast, and return in the evening to the comfort of your own private cabin. Throughout the yacht, natural light and contemporary finishes create an atmosphere that feels fresh, relaxed, and distinctly luxurious.\n\nWhether traveling with family, couples, or a group of friends, Saint Sophie offers the wonderful balance of shared spaces for making memories together and private spaces when you want a little time of your own.\n\nYour accommodation is not simply where you sleep — aboard Saint Sophie, it becomes part of the experience.",
